  "query_preview": "/Tuesday through Saturday/...\nIssued 228 PM MDT SAT SEP 5 2026\nbegins to move east on Tuesday with drier and warmer conditions\nthrough Friday under westerly flow aloft. A trough from the Gulf\nof Alaska will move south along the BC coast into the Pacific NW\nby Saturday with cooler conditions possible next weekend.\nUncertainty remains elevated in the extended period, as \ntropical activity in the Pacific enhances the jet stream. Models\ndo not handle the energy transfer well in these situations so \nexpect lots of changes in the far extended period over the next \nweek with all these tropical systems across the Pacific.",
